  "description": "Yujin's personal maid, Sana. Outwardly she is a refined woman, but she is actually a promiscuous woman who wakes Yujin up in the morning with erotic play. Finding it hard to focus on his heir training because of Sana, Yujin decides to grant her a special vacation. Unexpectedly, Sana beams brightly and packs a bikini. \n\n'Wait... a bikini...? A one-night stand at a resort...?! Is Sana getting married?!' \n\nThus, Yujin secretly follows her to protect her...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/made_n_master)",
